\[\lambda_{\pm}=\frac{1}{2}\left[\sigma^{xx}+\sigma^{yy}\pm\sqrt{\left(\sigma^{xx} -\sigma^{yy}\right)^{2}+4\left(\sigma^{xy}\right)^{2}}\right] \tag{3.10}\]

