In order to assess the impact this gain correction has on \(\pi^{0}\)s for the \(A_{LL}^{\pi^{0}}\) analysis, the shift in \(p_{T}\) must be measured, since we ultimately measure \(A_{LL}^{\pi^{0}}\) as a function of \(p_{T}\). The shifted \(p_{T}\), defined as \(p_{T_{t}}\), is

